# shell: desktop
# open: /dev/shm
# The moments that sound, heard through their count rather than a card:
# the chime as the boot screen came up, a window opening, the beep of an
# alert once one opens, and nothing for a moment that did not happen.  A
# scripted run is mute, so this proves the moments, not the speaker.
wait 20
expect-sound startup
expect-sound window-open
expect-no-sound beep
expect-no-sound shutdown
note the volume shown cannot be unmounted, and the refusal is an alert
key u ctrl
wait 15
expect-alert could not be unmounted
expect-sound beep
key Escape
wait 3
quit
